<description>&lt;p&gt;IS-linked ADF gunmen have stepped up attacks on civilians in Ituri province, killing dozens in villages such as Cantine and targeting health workers amid the Ebola outbreak. The DRC army captured an alleged ADF intelligence officer, while the Uganda People’s Defence Force rotated troops under Operation Shujaa to counter the ADF threat. Armed groups continue to block Ebola response and civilian protection. The conflict still accounts for 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPUlNKa1czLUlvUUJzZkNRNlUwamRMX3FJWGc5X0lSNjQ5Wjl3TjhVNkpaVHYtdy1BdU9EV3F1ajJ4cXg3clVDdzRyTFNVUVhmUTZoNWcxQU5wTUx6UExfcHpyTGFuX1Y3b3Z3WTVNN0w1aDJWMXBDM3kzcmw5a3h5VVh3eDc2RU5sbm1qN1ZIbGdacVNTazVrU0FzWkxpaUw3eXVsZEtQc0ZPcG5EaXRwX2NGSkc0aVN1UndYRHp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBqQ01qb3lwNWhSR0VzZy1pZ2Rxa0VKNllXa0FOaGVJeWg5bnROUm9VaGZhODYwbnQ0Rl9VbXd3THBCMU5LR2tyQkVUWVl1cmFDZV8xckVvaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOdzNDQmxiZlVpcTNSOGNDVWQxM2ItZ3dPUU5VWVUzZWp3X2pSUTBDdlNlSGRSNXp5UVVoTkV1RDBMV1RPSGRpeHBZdzkzWTNyaWRrQkloNFlRcEVVRjBCdVJlc2FCZnNWV0VrS0xqenpLdEhmN3RkVU4xWng2c3RwOFNFZmpWeEdfOTVWVUh6NlktdjNUcGp0QlozT3R3aF9jeGVieDF4ZVlfZHBKU0lLa3RR?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOZXJyT3FNaEtPbFp5T3B1VG1sUjJWWk1VbnR1aTM1SWFJWEFuMEo3RE5qRHdZM0JCS3V2Smg2NmlZNWl6NVh3U3JNMTF2NlM5RWVwV3B6SE9MYUdGUEVPZW1zZG9aYVJaQThLMFBwR1o1VXh4X2lvckhvRFh2UGNjc1RDN09iYk9qZS1PWE5VSDFoWFRFUGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Maliweb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;